  "bodyHash": "f936db3f9b520864",
  "content": "\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n受夠了那些像素過於粗糙、數量有限且沒有合適選擇介面的畫作嗎？\n《Immersive Paintings》允許用戶透過拖曳、截圖或提供網址，來建立屬於自己的、具有 Minecraft 風格的畫作。\n無需安裝資源包，完美支援多人遊戲且操作簡便。\n</p>\n\n<p>本模組提供了一個簡單卻功能強大的介面，讓您能輕鬆選擇自己的畫作、其他玩家的畫作，或是透過可選數據包提供的畫作。內建預設數據包，讓您快速上手！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>創作選單讓您可以快速為圖片進行像素化處理，並套用後製效果與抖動濾鏡，讓畫面自然融入 Minecraft 風格，無需繁瑣設定。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>但精美的畫作若沒有考究的畫框，豈不是少了點什麼？從多種風格與豐富材質中挑選，為您的藝術作品增添焦點。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>採用智慧細節等級、快取機制與惰性串流技術，效能影響微乎其微。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>還提供發光顏料版本！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>圖片包含透明背景？沒問題，使用塗鴉功能將其噴繪在任何牆壁上！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>以下是合成配方。</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersivePaintings%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"自動生成的合成配方圖片\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n相容於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\">Joy of Painting</a>！\n只需將畫布貼在畫作上即可展示！\n</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>給伺服器管理員</h1>\n<p>\n《Immersive Paintings》需要傳輸和儲存圖片，在伺服器上可能會累積大量檔案。如果您的伺服器頻寬不足或儲存空間有限，請查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\">設定檔</a>。\n它提供了針對使用者的限制選項與頻寬節流功能，方便您依需求調整。\n</p>\n\n<h1>數據包</h1>\n<p>\n您也可以選擇使用\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\">數據包</a>\n來分享成組的畫作。\n</p>\n\n<h1>翻譯支援</h1>\n<p>\n希望模組能支援您的語言？歡迎前往\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a>\n協助翻譯本模組。\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列 (Immersive Collection)</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>擴充模組</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful%20Addon&description=32px%20texture%20pack%20addon%20for%20Faithful.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Faithful Addon\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/arids-immersive-resprites\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids%20Immersive%20Resprites&description=Resprites%20for%20the%20Immersive%20Melodies%20and%20Immersive%20Paintings%20mods%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Arids Immersive Resprites\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=f79ed7591f3496f8580139e47ae744c3\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，便於部署。\"/>",
